# File ownership, enforced rather than described.
#
# ADR-0018 makes each area's directory its boundary — the mechanism that lets several
# agents work at once without fighting over the same file. Until this file existed that
# boundary lived only in prose, in CLAUDE.md, which an agent reads and a diff does not.
#
# GitHub uses this to request review automatically. It does not block a merge on its own;
# branch protection does that, and the review request is what makes a crossing visible.
#
# One caveat worth knowing, because it has already bitten this repository: ownership is
# per *directory*, so it cannot see a collision that lives in a shared *string*. The
# shell's `.ff-tab` and the design system's `.ff-tab` sat in different owned files and
# silently restyled each other. Prefix a class with the component that owns it.

*                                   @ashwinraghav

# Integrator only. Four features appending to one route array is exactly the collision
# ADR-0018 exists to prevent, so these stay with one owner however small the change.
/package.json                       @ashwinraghav
/pnpm-workspace.yaml                @ashwinraghav
/tsconfig.base.json                 @ashwinraghav
